The domain class `Opportunities` applies the defaults in `onApplyDefaults()`. fflib calls this hook only during before insert, so updates never get the defaults. Inside the hook, the class fills in a missing `CloseDate` or `Type` on each record in `Records`, which is the trigger batch. It runs no SOQL or DML, so it is bulk-safe. Values that are already set are left alone.

